---
import FutureShell from "../../../prototypes/futures/FutureShell.astro";
---
<FutureShell title="Business ritual" description="Three websites shaped by the repeated work of the businesses behind them." current="ritual" tone="workshop">
  <section class="ritual-hero"><div class="ritual-hero-copy"><p class="future-label">A website should learn the work</p><h1 class="future-display">Not a template.<br />A repeated act.</h1><p>Every good local business has a moment it performs again and again. Put that moment at the centre and the interface stops feeling transferable.</p></div><div class="ritual-loop" aria-label="The repeated business ritual"><span>Customer arrives</span><i>→</i><span>Business makes a judgement</span><i>→</i><span>A promise is confirmed</span><i>↺</i></div></section>
  <section class="ritual-lab" id="ritual-lab">
    <nav class="ritual-tabs" aria-label="Choose a business ritual"><button type="button" data-tab="repair" aria-selected="true">Workshop repair</button><button type="button" data-tab="stay">Hotel stay</button><button type="button" data-tab="round">Farm round</button></nav>
    <article class="ritual-example" data-example="repair">
      <div class="ritual-story"><p class="future-label">Mourne Cycles</p><h2 class="future-display">The mechanic must see it before promising it.</h2><p>The site can collect the useful first facts. It cannot turn workshop judgement into fake live availability.</p><ol><li><b>Rider names the job</b><span>Puncture, service, gears, brake or “not sure.”</span></li><li><b>Rider offers a day</b><span>A preference, not a booked slot.</span></li><li><b>Workshop confirms</b><span>The real promise remains with the person doing the work.</span></li></ol></div>
      <div class="ritual-device repair-device"><div class="device-head">Workshop check <span>Step <b data-step-number>1</b> of 3</span></div><div class="device-step is-active" data-step="0"><h3>What needs looked at?</h3><div class="service-choices"><button>Puncture</button><button>Service</button><button>Gears</button><button>Not sure</button></div><button class="ritual-next">Choose a preferred day →</button></div><div class="device-step" data-step="1"><h3>Which day suits you?</h3><div class="day-choices"><button>Tue 11</button><button>Wed 12</button><button>Thu 13</button></div><p>This is a preference. The workshop confirms every job.</p><button class="ritual-next">Send the useful details →</button></div><div class="device-step" data-step="2"><h3>Ready for the workshop.</h3><div class="ticket-output"><b>Service</b><span>Preferred: Wednesday 12 August</span><small>Slot not yet confirmed</small></div><button class="ritual-restart">Try again</button></div></div>
    </article>
    <article class="ritual-example" data-example="stay" hidden>
      <div class="ritual-story"><p class="future-label">Enniskeen Hotel</p><h2 class="future-display">A stay begins with time, then becomes place.</h2><p>The hotel’s booking engine needs only arrival and nights. The site’s role is to make those dates feel worth spending here.</p><ol><li><b>Choose the shape of the stay</b><span>One night to reset, or three to settle in.</span></li><li><b>See the estate change</b><span>The suggested day grows around the chosen time.</span></li><li><b>Hand off cleanly</b><span>Dates pass to the real booking engine.</span></li></ol></div>
      <div class="ritual-device stay-device"><div class="stay-image"><img src="/media/concepts/hotel-enniskeen/enniskeen-faithful-house-dusk-1265.webp" alt="Illustrative dusk view of Enniskeen House" width="1265" height="710" /></div><div class="stay-control"><label>How long can you stay?<input type="range" min="1" max="4" value="2" /></label><strong><span data-nights>2</span> nights</strong><p data-stay-copy>Firelit arrival · a full estate day · breakfast before the road</p><button>Check those dates →</button></div></div>
    </article>
    <article class="ritual-example" data-example="round" hidden>
      <div class="ritual-story"><p class="future-label">Castle Farm</p><h2 class="future-display">The week is packed before the road is driven.</h2><p>The useful interface follows the farm’s real rhythm: what is ready, where the round goes, and when a customer must decide.</p><ol><li><b>See this week’s table</b><span>The farm controls the changing list.</span></li><li><b>Find the round</b><span>Place matters more than a generic shop grid.</span></li><li><b>Join before packing</b><span>The deadline is tied to the work, not urgency theatre.</span></li></ol></div>
      <div class="ritual-device round-device"><div class="crate"><p>This week’s table</p><button data-produce="eggs">Eggs <b>+</b></button><button data-produce="greens">Greens <b>+</b></button><button data-produce="box">Farm box <b>+</b></button></div><div class="round-line"><span>Castlewellan</span><i></i><span>Dundrum</span><i></i><span>Newcastle</span></div><div class="packing"><p>Your place in the round</p><strong data-basket>Choose from the table</strong><button>Ask for this week →</button></div></div>
    </article>
  </section>
  <section class="ritual-test future-shell"><h2 class="future-display">The ritual is not decoration.</h2><div><p><b>Without it</b>A bike shop, hotel and farm inherit the same hero, feature grid and contact form.</p><p><b>With it</b>Each site asks for different information, makes a different promise and stops at the point where human judgement begins.</p></div></section>
</FutureShell>
<script>
  const lab=document.getElementById("ritual-lab")!;lab.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>("[data-tab]").forEach(button=>button.addEventListener("click",()=>{lab.querySelectorAll("[data-tab]").forEach(b=>b.setAttribute("aria-selected",String(b===button)));lab.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>("[data-example]").forEach(example=>example.hidden=example.dataset.example!==button.dataset.tab)}));
  let repairStep=0;const steps=[...lab.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>(".repair-device .device-step")];const showRepair=(step:number)=>{repairStep=step;steps.forEach((item,index)=>item.classList.toggle("is-active",index===step));lab.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-step-number]")!.textContent=String(step+1)};lab.querySelectorAll(".repair-device .ritual-next").forEach(button=>button.addEventListener("click",()=>showRepair(Math.min(2,repairStep+1))));lab.querySelector(".ritual-restart")?.addEventListener("click",()=>showRepair(0));
  const stay=lab.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>(".stay-device input")!;stay.addEventListener("input",()=>{const nights=Number(stay.value);lab.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-nights]")!.textContent=String(nights);const copy=["A late arrival · breakfast · the road home","Firelit arrival · a full estate day · breakfast before the road","Arrival · two unhurried days · the long breakfast","The estate at your pace · room for weather to change"][nights-1];lab.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-stay-copy]")!.textContent=copy});
  const picks=new Set<string>();lab.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>("[data-produce]").forEach(button=>button.addEventListener("click",()=>{const item=button.dataset.produce!;picks.has(item)?picks.delete(item):picks.add(item);button.setAttribute("aria-pressed",String(picks.has(item)));lab.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-basket]")!.textContent=picks.size?[...picks].map(x=>x==="box"?"Farm box":x[0].toUpperCase()+x.slice(1)).join(" · "):"Choose from the table"}));
</script>
<style>
  .ritual-hero{min-height:65vh;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.25fr .75fr;align-items:end;gap:3rem;padding:clamp(5rem,10vw,9rem) clamp(1.2rem,5vw,4.5rem) 4rem;color:white;background:var(--future-sea)}.ritual-hero h1{max-width:10ch;margin:.5rem 0 1rem;font-size:clamp(4.5rem,10vw,6rem);line-height:.86}.ritual-hero-copy>p:last-child{max-width:39rem;font-size:1.08rem;line-height:1.55}.ritual-loop{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:.75rem;font-weight:750}.ritual-loop span{padding:.75rem 1rem;color:var(--future-ink);background:var(--future-gorse)}.ritual-loop i{margin-left:2rem;font-style:normal;color:var(--future-gorse)}
  .ritual-tabs{display:flex;background:var(--future-ink)}.ritual-tabs button{flex:1;min-height:62px;padding:.7rem;color:rgb(244 248 250 / 62%);background:transparent;border:0;border-right:1px solid rgb(244 248 250 / 20%);font-weight:750}.ritual-tabs button[aria-selected="true"]{color:var(--future-ink);background:var(--future-gorse)}.ritual-example{min-height:760px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr;background:var(--future-mist)}.ritual-example[hidden]{display:none}.ritual-story{padding:clamp(3rem,7vw,7rem) clamp(1.4rem,5vw,4.5rem)}.ritual-story h2{margin:.7rem 0 1.4rem;font-size:clamp(3.2rem,6vw,5.4rem);line-height:.9}.ritual-story>p:not(.future-label){max-width:38rem;font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.55}.ritual-story ol{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:3rem 0 0;border-top:2px solid var(--future-ink)}.ritual-story li{padding:1rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgb(19 32 41 / 28%)}.ritual-story li b,.ritual-story li span{display:block}.ritual-story li span{font-size:.85rem;color:var(--future-deep)}
  .ritual-device{align-self:center;width:min(560px,90%);min-height:600px;margin:4rem auto;background:white;border:5px solid var(--future-ink);box-shadow:12px 12px 0 rgb(19 32 41 / 22%)}.device-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:1rem;color:white;background:var(--future-ink);font-weight:750}.device-step{display:none;padding:clamp(1.4rem,5vw,3rem)}.device-step.is-active{display:block}.device-step h3{font:680 clamp(2.5rem,5vw,4rem)/.9 Antonio,sans-serif}.service-choices,.day-choices{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:.6rem;margin:2rem 0}.service-choices button,.day-choices button{min-height:74px;background:var(--future-mist);border:2px solid var(--future-ink);font-weight:750}.service-choices button:focus,.day-choices button:focus{background:var(--future-gorse)}.ritual-next,.ritual-restart{width:100%;min-height:52px;color:white;background:var(--future-sea);border:0;font-weight:750}.ticket-output{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1rem;padding:2rem;margin:2rem 0;background:var(--future-gorse);border:2px dashed var(--future-ink)}
  .stay-device{display:grid;grid-template-rows:1fr auto}.stay-image{min-height:330px;overflow:hidden}.stay-image img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}.stay-control{padding:2rem;background:#163c2e;color:white}.stay-control label{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.7rem}.stay-control input{width:100%;accent-color:var(--future-gorse)}.stay-control strong{display:block;margin:.6rem 0;font:680 3rem Antonio,sans-serif}.stay-control button,.packing button{width:100%;min-height:50px;background:var(--future-gorse);border:0;font-weight:750}
  .round-device{background:#244c3e;padding:2rem;color:white}.crate{padding:1.5rem;color:var(--future-ink);background:#dfc98b;border:8px solid #8f6d33}.crate>p{font:680 2rem Antonio,sans-serif;margin-top:0}.crate button{width:100%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:.7rem;background:transparent;border:0;border-top:1px solid var(--future-ink);text-align:left}.crate button[aria-pressed="true"]{background:var(--future-gorse)}.round-line{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin:3rem 0;font-size:.76rem}.round-line i{flex:1;border-top:3px dotted var(--future-gorse)}.packing strong{display:block;margin:.5rem 0 1.2rem;font:680 2rem Antonio,sans-serif}.ritual-test{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:4rem;padding-block:clamp(5rem,10vw,9rem)}.ritual-test h2{margin:0;font-size:clamp(3rem,6vw,5rem);line-height:.9}.ritual-test div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:2rem}.ritual-test b{display:block;color:var(--future-sea);font-size:1.15rem}
  @media(max-width:800px){.ritual-hero,.ritual-example,.ritual-test{grid-template-columns:1fr}.ritual-loop{margin-top:2rem}.ritual-example{min-height:unset}.ritual-tabs{overflow-x:auto}.ritual-tabs button{min-width:150px}.ritual-device{min-height:550px}.ritual-test div{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
